  "summary": "Selected evidence records: A design doc dated 2025-01-26 addresses terminal focus escape sequences ([I]/[O]) appearing as literal text in the chat input when modals are shown, because Ink strips the escape prefix. The chosen fix is a global always-active useInput hook in ChatInput.tsx to intercept focus events, with a simplified skip-handler kept in TextInput as a safety net.",
